WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.300
Narrator: Noura spots an older man who seems lost after the match.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:10.600
Noura: Assalamu alaikum, uncle. I'm Noura - I work for the event. Can I help you find your family?

3
00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:16.200
Narrator: She introduces herself respectfully, says she works for the event, and asks how she can help.

